From 43f52976b2cd6e1ec80152d6d0854093ed2ee1ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arena Agent <agent@arena.local>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 05:09:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Separate display image counts from recording slots

Carry the presentation chain's requested minimum and actual image count into Dear ImGui instead of RecordingSlotCount. Retain both counts across chain reconstruction, validate their relation, and renegotiate from DisplayScheduler after each rebuild. Generated indexes remain for the local construction step.
---
